<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<project xmlns="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0"
         xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
         xsi:schemaLocation="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0 http://maven.apache.org/xsd/maven-4.0.0.xsd">
    <modelVersion>4.0.0</modelVersion>

    <parent>
        <groupId>io.github.aigoodle</groupId>
        <artifactId>agent-start</artifactId>
        <version>0.1.0</version>
    </parent>

    <artifactId>agent-start-web-spring-starter</artifactId>
    <name>agent-start-web-spring-starter</name>
    <description>
        Spring Boot Starter —— MVC/Tomcat 侧的 REST CRUD 层聚合。
        引入本 starter 即等价于同时引入:
          - agent-start-web         REST CRUD 端点 (含 springdoc / swagger-webmvc)
          - agent-start-model       模型/凭证/预设 provider
          - agent-start-agent       Agent 运行时(ReAct / FunctionCalling) + 记忆 + HITL
          - agent-start-workflow    DAG 工作流引擎 + 内置节点
          - agent-start-knowledge   知识库 / RAG / 检索
          - agent-start-tools       Tool SPI + ToolRegistry
          - agent-start-trigger     触发器(定时 / 事件)
          - agent-start-observability LLM 调用 / token 消耗记录

        主类保持普通 @SpringBootApplication 即可,无需 @ComponentScan / @MapperScan ——
        各模块自己的 @AutoConfiguration 通过 META-INF/spring/*.imports 加载,并按
        @AutoConfigureAfter 排序保证 controller 里的 @ConditionalOnBean 不踩空。

        流式 chat (/chat-messages, /chat/completions/{appId}) 位于姊妹模块
        agent-start-completion-spring-starter (WebFlux/Netty)。需要该端点的项目请再引一份。
    </description>

    <dependencies>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>io.github.aigoodle</groupId>
            <artifactId>agent-start-web</artifactId>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>io.github.aigoodle</groupId>
            <artifactId>agent-start-model</artifactId>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>io.github.aigoodle</groupId>
            <artifactId>agent-start-agent</artifactId>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>io.github.aigoodle</groupId>
            <artifactId>agent-start-workflow</artifactId>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>io.github.aigoodle</groupId>
            <artifactId>agent-start-knowledge</artifactId>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>io.github.aigoodle</groupId>
            <artifactId>agent-start-tools</artifactId>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>io.github.aigoodle</groupId>
            <artifactId>agent-start-trigger</artifactId>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>io.github.aigoodle</groupId>
            <artifactId>agent-start-observability</artifactId>
        </dependency>
    </dependencies>
</project>
